WarmongeAlaisha: Look at you! You've finally become a Tyro Warrior. Looks like you're slouch after all.
WarmongeAlaisha: Selecting your class is probably one of the biggest feats of becoming a Starspire Hunter. Now you can unlock Combat Abilities. *HUZZAH*
WarmongeAlaisha: Combat abilities are special moves that you can assign AP to. Each class will have exactly 4 active abilities that will greatly contribute to your efficiency as a Hunter.
WarmongeAlaisha: Combat abilities are designed to synergize each other in order to maximize combat effectiveness, so don't just favor one (even if you might want to).
WarmongeAlaisha: As a Tyro, your best in melee damage, crowd control, and tanking enemy hits. You love to get personal, so this Class is perfect for you.
WarmongeAlaisha: You have 2 more class advancements to go, with a Hunter like you, this is about to get interesting!